      "description": "Time etcd spends on a request, per member. Unary requests only, without Watch and Lease streams.\n\nOne member is slow: its node, see 'Node CPU', 'Disk Sync Duration p99', 'DB Reads from Disk'.\n\nAll members are slow: the leader or the network, see 'Leader', 'Disk Sync Duration p99', 'Peer RTT p99'.\n\nSpikes every 5 minutes: compaction, see 'Compaction: Write Pause p99'.\n\nNothing explains it: etcd logs every request slower than 100ms with its key and size, search the etcd log for 'apply request took too long'.",
