      "description": "Round trip between members over the raft channel. Empty in single-master clusters.\n\nEvery write waits for a round trip to the majority, every read checks the leader: RTT adds to both.\n\nClose to the election timeout (1s), or packet loss: heartbeats do not arrive in time and the leader changes, see 'Leader'.\n\nOne direction A -> B is high: the problem is on B or on this link. All directions of one node are high: the network of this node.\n\n'unknown member': Prometheus has no metrics from this member, it is not scraped or has no node any more, compare with 'etcdctl member list'.",
